# Local quality judge. qwen3.5 thinks before answering; with Ollama's default
# 4096-token context the thinking can fill the window and leave no room for the
# JSON verdict. This variant shares the qwen3.5:4b weights (no extra disk).
#
#   ollama create qwen3.5-judge -f eval/litellm/judge.Modelfile
FROM qwen3.5:4b
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
